<title>UK: Amey wins 85 mln stg motorway contract.</title>
<headline>Amey wins 85 mln stg motorway contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amey Plc said on Monday that the Highways Agency had accepted its 85 million stg bid to manage and maintain all motorways and trunk roads in the counties of Berkshire, Buckinghamshire, Oxfordshire, Hertfordshire and Essex.  </p>
<p>It said the contract covered all routine winter and emergency maintenance work on around 465 kilometres (290 miles) of motorways and trunk roads, together with 1,800 associated structures.</p>
<p>The three-year contract starts on April 1, with an option to extend for a further year at the end of the period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
